sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer (web / mini app)
    participant A as api
    participant W as worker
    participant S as scheduler
    participant X as Waxpeer
    participant ST as Steam

    C->>A: POST /skins/tradelink/check (advisory)
    A->>X: check-tradelink
    A->>ST: GetTradeHoldDurations
    A-->>C: ok / private / trade_ban / hold / unavailable
    C->>A: POST /orders (cs2-skin: slug, listing_id, tradelink)
    A->>A: skins.checkout — price the live listing (±2 %), snapshot expected_units
    C->>A: pay (any acquirer)
    A->>W: payment succeeded → fulfilment task (pg_notify)
    W->>X: check-many-project-id (replay?) then buy-one-p2p(project_id, price ≤ paid)
    alt listing gone
        W->>X: search → buy a same-name auto listing ≤ paid (max 2)
    end
    loop every 5–10 s
        S->>X: check-many-project-id
        S->>A: skin_trades mirror; order page polls GET /orders/{id}
    end
    alt status 4 + release_date (accepted)
        S->>A: task succeeded → order delivered
        loop hourly until release_date
            S->>X: check-many-project-id (protection watch)
        end
    else status 6 (declined / expired / sold out)
        S->>A: task failed RETURNED → refund_order_to_wallet
        A-->>C: money on the YuPay balance
    end
